 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
+- Queue management and call authorization: `App\Actions\CreateQueue` and `UpdateQueue` (owner/admin; rename, re-slug, activate/deactivate; no delete), `App\Actions\SetQueueAccess` (owner/admin grants or revokes the `call` permission of an employee on a queue, audited as `queue.access.granted` / `queue.access.revoked`), the `queue_access` table with `App\Models\QueueAccess` and factory, `App\Enums\QueuePermission`, and `App\Policies\QueuePolicy` (`create`, `update`, `manageAccess`, `call`). `CallNextTicket` (every mode) and `Ticket::call()` now require the caller to be allowed to call on the queue, so calls by employees without a grant are refused. Documented in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md) and [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
